    "summary": "Explicitly roots all 23 numerical domain and dynamic presentation entry points, proves that the generated browser bundle contains all 67 public numerical modules, and exercises representative operations and PlotSpec witnesses in real Chromium. The built-artifact Chromium witness is a named package command required by routine Wasm CI and protected by the release-gate contract test. The final browser artifact remains within the unchanged 5% compressed-growth gate and reviewed eager-core topology ceilings.",
